        "question_id": "a2222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
        "body": "On 15 May 2024 Mrs A told Dr P she had had bright red rectal bleeding for three weeks. Iron deficiency anaemia had been found in February and not explained.\n\nIn my opinion, a reasonably competent GP seeing this presentation in a 58-year-old with known anaemia would have examined the abdomen and rectum, and considered referral on a suspected cancer pathway.\n\nThe record shows no examination was carried out.",
